{"saha supa": [{"id": "saha supA", "headword": "सह सुपा", "headword_slp1": "saha supA", "fold": "saha supa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The words सह सुपा meaning 'with a word ending in a case-affix', are to be understood in each of the succeeding aphorisms.\n\nTerms: समास", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["सह सुपा २.१.४", "२.१.४", "२.१.४ सह सुपा"], "synonyms_slp1": ["saha supA २.१.४", "२.१.४", "२.१.४ saha supA"]}], "sahayuktepraDane": [{"id": "sahayukte'praDAne", "headword": "सहयुक्तेऽप्रधाने", "headword_slp1": "sahayukte'praDAne", "fold": "sahayuktepraDane", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "When the word सह 'with', is joined to a word the latter takes the 3rd case, when the sense is that the word in the 3rd case is not the principal but the accompaniment of the principal thing.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-3", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["सहयुक्तेऽप्रधाने २.३.१९", "२.३.१९", "२.३.१९ सहयुक्तेऽप्रधाने"], "synonyms_slp1": ["sahayukte'praDAne २.३.१९", "२.३.१९", "२.३.१९ sahayukte'praDAne"]}], "sahe ca": [{"id": "sahe ca", "headword": "सहे च", "headword_slp1": "sahe ca", "fold": "sahe ca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix क्वनिप्‌ comes after the verbs युध 'to fight' and कृ 'to make' with a past signification when the word सह 'with', is in composition.\n\nTerms: क्वनिप्‌", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["सहे च ३.२.९६", "३.२.९६", "३.२.९६ सहे च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["sahe ca ३.२.९६", "३.२.९६", "३.२.९६ sahe ca"]}], "sahanaYvidyamanapurvaca": [{"id": "sahanaYvidyamAnapUrvAcca", "headword": "सहनञ्विद्यमानपूर्वाच्च", "headword_slp1": "sahanaYvidyamAnapUrvAcca", "fold": "sahanaYvidyamanapurvaca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix ङीष् does not come in the feminine after a प्रातिपदिक (Nominal Stem) denoting a part of the body when the word is subordinate in a compound, preceded by the word 1. सह 'with' 2. नञ् 'not' or 3. विद्यमान 'having'.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-ङीष्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["सहनञ्विद्यमानपूर्वाच्च ४.१.५७", "४.१.५७", "४.१.५७ सहनञ्विद्यमानपूर्वाच्च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["sahanaYvidyamAnapUrvAcca ४.१.५७", "४.१.५७", "४.१.५७ sahanaYvidyamAnapUrvAcca"]}], "sahasreRa sanmitO GaH": [{"id": "sahasreRa saMmitO GaH", "headword": "सहस्रेण संमितौ घः", "headword_slp1": "sahasreRa saMmitO GaH", "fold": "sahasreRa sanmitO GaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix घ comes in the sense of 'like' after the word सहस्र in the Instrumental -3rd case in construction, in the छन्दस् (Vedas).\n\nTerms: घ", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["सहस्रेण संमितौ घः ४.४.१३५", "४.४.१३५", "४.४.१३५ सहस्रेण संमितौ घः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["sahasreRa saMmitO GaH ४.४.१३५", "४.४.१३५", "४.४.१३५ sahasreRa saMmitO GaH"]}], "sahasya saH sanjYayam": [{"id": "sahasya saH saMjYAyAm", "headword": "सहस्य सः संज्ञायाम्", "headword_slp1": "sahasya saH saMjYAyAm", "fold": "sahasya saH sanjYayam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "स is substituted for सह , in a Name.\n\nTerms: स Substitute", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["सहस्य सः संज्ञायाम् ६.३.७८", "६.३.७८", "६.३.७८ सहस्य सः संज्ञायाम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["sahasya saH saMjYAyAm ६.३.७८", "६.३.७८", "६.३.७८ sahasya saH saMjYAyAm"]}], "sahasya saDriH": [{"id": "sahasya saDriH", "headword": "सहस्य सध्रिः", "headword_slp1": "sahasya saDriH", "fold": "sahasya saDriH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "सघ्रि is the substitute of सह before अञ्च् when no affix (or व affix) follows.\n\nTerms: Some Substitution", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["सहस्य सध्रिः ६.३.९५", "६.३.९५", "६.३.९५ सहस्य सध्रिः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["sahasya saDriH ६.३.९५", "६.३.९५", "६.३.९५ sahasya saDriH"]}], "sahivahorodavarRasya": [{"id": "sahivahorodav